{"label":"Fuel and trip cost","slots":{"distance":"km","mileage":"km/L","price":"currency units/L","litres":"L","cost":"currency units"},"rules":[{"id":"fuel.litres","output":"litres","inputs":["distance","mileage"],"expr":{"op":"/","args":[{"ref":"distance"},{"ref":"mileage"}]},"formula":"distance ÷ mileage","cost":1,"weight":1},{"id":"fuel.cost","output":"cost","inputs":["litres","price"],"expr":{"op":"*","args":[{"ref":"litres"},{"ref":"price"}]},"formula":"fuel needed × price per litre","cost":1,"weight":1}],"assumptions":["Constant fuel economy and price; other running costs excluded."]}